OL,3,APip benefits review expected to push
OL,4,Afor quicker payments for some disabled
OL,5,Apeople
OL,6,
OL,7,FFour million people claim Pip, a
OL,8,Fregular cash payment towards the extra
OL,9,Fcosts of being disabled. Eligibility
OL,10,Fisn't dependent on income
OL,12,FCharity Scope says the Pip process is
OL,13,F"stressful and degrading"; one woman
OL,14,Fwho uses the payment says "in any
OL,15,Fdealings with the benefits system you
OL,16,Ffeel like you're on trial"
